abstract: >-
  Models weekday commutes by public transport and by car from 1,197 Electoral Divisions across Leinster (except
  Wexford) and County Monaghan to 14 higher-education campuses, at two times of day, with the annual cost and carbon of each journey, its
  distribution by area deprivation and car availability, a validation against Census 2022 journeys, and a
  county-scale model of whether accessibility predicts where new entrants enrol. Individual research and analysis, not an official
  Maynooth University publication. Code MIT; derived tables ODbL 1.0; report CC BY 4.0.
